    "Every chat will be deleted, including the current one. This can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Under 'Delete all chats?': says that the chat on screen is deleted too, and that the deletion is final.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سيتم حذف كل الدردشات، بما فيها الدردشة الحالية. لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smažou se všechny chaty, včetně aktuálního. Tuto akci nelze vrátit zpět."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle chats slettes, også den nuværende. Det kan ikke fortrydes."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle Chats werden gelöscht, auch der aktuelle. Dies kann nicht widerrufen werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every chat will be deleted, including the current one. This can’t be undone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminarán todos los chats, incluido el actual. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminarán todos los chats, incluido el actual. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toutes les discussions seront supprimées, y compris la discussion actuelle. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "כל הצ׳אטים יימחקו, כולל הצ׳אט הנוכחי. לא ניתן לבטל פעולה זו."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semua obrolan akan dihapus, termasuk obrolan saat ini. Tindakan ini tidak dapat dibatalkan."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutte le chat verranno eliminate, compresa quella attuale. L’operazione non può essere annullata."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在のチャットを含むすべてのチャットが削除されます。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "현재 채팅을 포함한 모든 채팅이 삭제됩니다. 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle chatter slettes, også den nåværende. Dette kan ikke angres."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle chats worden verwijderd, ook de huidige. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
